        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Why twice?&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Two models read the page without seeing each&#xa;other&#39;s answer. Agreeing is evidence. Disagreeing&#xa;drops the confidence and a person looks.&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Why the quote?&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Every value carries the line it was read from. If&#xa;that line is not on the page, the value is not used.&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;What posts on its own?&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Only a document with no failing rule, high&#xa;confidence, every required field, and every&#xa;important value traceable to the page." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="320" x="670" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
